-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">) 18시 30분</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">◆</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><font face=\"Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\">※</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\">1차 시험(15일) 미응시자 2차 시험(22일) 응시 불가</span></b></span></font><b style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\">※</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">※</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">응시생들은&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">18</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">시 1</span><span style=\"background-image: initial