kground-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><b>필기 도구</b></span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><b>:</b>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">연필,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">샤프, 볼펜, 사인펜&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">(</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">인적사항은 볼펜, 사인펜만 가능</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">)</span></p><p style=\"margin-right: 30pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: left; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-right: 30pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: left; line-height: 1;\"><b><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">인정 신분증 (학생증 불가)</span></b></p><p style=\"font-weight: bold; text-align: left; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">▶</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">규정 신분증</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">주민증록증</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">운전면허증</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">경찰청 발행</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">기간 만료 전의 여권</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">공무원증</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">장애인 복지 카드</span></p><pre style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem;\"><p style=\"padding-top: 10px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">*&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">위 규정 신분증에 명시되지 않은 신분증 및 유효기간이 지난 신분증 미인정</span></b></p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움; font-size: 13px;\"><u style=\"font-family: null;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">학생증은 규정 신분증이 아니므로 시험 응시가 절대 불가</span></span></u></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움;\"><span style=\"font-family: null; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">*&nbsp;사진으로 찍은 신분증&nbsp;인정 불가능</span></span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움;\"><span style=\"font-family: null; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">* 시험 끝나고 가지고 오는 것 불가능</span></span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움;\"><span style=\"font-family: null; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">* 원스톱에 등재하지 않고 성적 확인만 하는 것 불가능</span></span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움;\"><span style=\"font-family: null; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">* 규정 신분증이 아닌 경우 무조건 즉시 퇴실(예외 없음)</span></span></span></p></pre><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-weight: bold; text-align: left; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">▶</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">대체 가능 증명서</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">해당 동사무소에서 발급한 기간 만료 전의&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">주민등록증 발급신청 확인서</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">를 발급 받아오시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">.</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; text-align: left; line-height: 1;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-right: 30pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; backg